<title>JAPAN: GOVERNMENT LIST.</title>
<headline>GOVERNMENT LIST.</headline>
<text>
<p>JAPAN GOVERNMENT LIST (961107)</p>
<p> Head of State (Enthroned 12 Nov 90)...........Emperor AKIHITO</p>
<p>				 - - - - - - -</p>
<p> Prime Minister..............................Ryutaro HASHIMOTO</p>
<p>(Apptd 11 Jan 96, re-elected 7 Nov 96)</p>
